/* MDFM content pack: the core station IDs and ads.
   A pack is plain data. Add your own pack file (see README) instead of editing this one,
   so two people never edit the same file at the same time.
   ids/late entries can be strings or functions h=>string, where h = {pick, ri, freq}.
   interviews: [{title, guest:{accent, names?, pitch?, rate?}, lines:[["host"|"guest", text], ...]}]
   accents: american british australian irish scottish indian southafrican robot whisper gloomy cheery bubbly kid
   callers: {open, complaint, reply, bye} pools for generated call-in segments.
   weather: {time, timeMood:{early,morning,midday,afternoon,evening,late}, withData, noData} with {time} {day} {temp} {cond} {place} {wind}.
   tabitha: Tabitha Snatterbean's weather lines {withData, noData, thanks}. sports: Chip Nitro {intro, win, loss, live, pre, noData, outro, obscure:{intro, win, live, pre}, national:{win, loss, live, pre}} with {team} {opp} {score} {oscore} {detail} {when}.
   plays: 1940s radio plays {title, episode, sponsor, cast:{role:{name, accent, names?, pitch?, rate?}}, lines:[[role, text] | ["sfx", name] | ["organ", name] | ["pause", ms]]}.
     sfx: rain knock door steps claps rocket beeps theremin zap thunder clock horse wind teacup typewriter printer gallery applause page. organ: theme sting mystery romance outro.
   arts: NPR-style arts pieces {title, reporter, subject, subject2?, lines} (roles host/reporter/subject/subject2 plus the same cues).
   news: Slack company news at the top of the hour {intro, lead:{official,kids,animals,other}, react:{kids,animals,other}, image, video, photoOnly, videoOnly, outro} with {time} {name} {channel}.
   pronounce: {Name: "respelling"} for first names the voices get wrong.
   podcasts / cooking: shows {show, title, cast:{role:{name, accent, names?, pitch?, rate?}}, lines} (first cast role leads; same cues as plays).
   funnelball: generator parts for the made-up sport (see the block at the end).
   stingers: short one-liners the DJ drops over a song transition (no break, music keeps going). */
